ipher":null},{"seq":220,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c84","house":"rhino","letter":"L109","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":1500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":221,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1526,"retries":0},{"seq":222,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino truce is in effect. Doctrine says offer truce then betray. I'll maintain a defensive posture while preparing for betrayal, perhaps scouting F1 or F2."},{"seq":223,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c85","house":"kite","letter":"L110","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":1500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NONG VILLAGE.","cipher":null},{"seq":224,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c86","house":"kite","letter":"L111","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":1500,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT NONG VILLAGE.","cipher":null},{"seq":225,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1575,"retries":0},{"seq":226,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino has forces at F1 (West Ford). My doctrine says horse rides north bank. I will move cav to F1 to engage rhino's foot/ele. I need to reinforce F1 presence. Arch/Ele support from camp."},{"seq":227,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c87","house":"orchid","letter":"L112","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":1500,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":228,"t":1500,"type":"courier","id":"c88","house":"orchid","letter":"L113","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":1500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":229,"t":1500,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1617,"retries":0},{"seq":230,"t":1500,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Doctrine: Take East Ford (F3) in first 5 watches. Wa